<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have beheaded six Christians and killed a Catholic priest after a baptism of 175 people, while security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia. In the same period, Mozambican forces killed three robbers at a micro-credit service, an incident that lies outside the insurgency. The United States warned of a growing ISIS threat to African maritime trade, and oil prices rebounded after shipping attacks near Hormuz. Flood releases from the Pongolapoort dam have raised flood risk in Maputo province. There were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5nUHJNZG5wNTNoTEJoeXYzWlhhNlIxcXFYclhQQVdKdkJ5d0ExWjBpR1NFRWpkSmQxeHd1dUNTYk1jaVpicXRFbi1za1p0WHhFWDJUNmlHbUlvM3NXTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNb0Q1SlE2SGNlaTBaMzMyV1U2T1g4Q1g4b28tR1FqVmVWUk9xUUtfSHVDN3RXMzJkUFVEN2lEbXMxclBpd25xYkJ1Q2poc1pjTkZJQXpqdGFuNmFRVC04MnRPb1RLLTc0blVaTWpXNzNjTmh5MUdzMU9jcnN5blFwMFJyYW1QQ3picUwzc1gzbjFRT2tLTzF6TGZUZUVNOEZnUV9paXNiX2F3UWpl?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Agenzia Fides&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQenhnN1duN1U2NzZqR0JFSTd0X2FJUVNVc0NhdDBDZ0gyQzdtVUdWamdnMEZDOFAyai1seUZfc1RmTWhqYU9aTFF1LURKcXVyWHYxTlVrWEkzbDhiM3YzZXBTcWI4TmtXa1ZjeVNabDVUc2pVNDhhc2w2MWpXSDBqRU5BMnZIYnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sport News Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1palNuYW5FeWo4MUZDNDJJWVdDNXlPbDlMOVVQT3JWQzVodnlvRXk4QnJITmpyZ2R3M0x5c29SUFBYWUQtYm9xQ0hMV25uWTQ5d014dnhseFJBUm1LV2lOZ29kbnJZSXU4YldfM0VJUUM0SlVIMVozU0cyOGVnRDg?oc